# Arena flagship transfer (2026-10-21), Modern mode, on the test-only battle
# test-starbound/arena-levels/transfer.pn, which destroys its own flagship at 5 s (tick 300).
# Cruiser #1 (initial 1) is saved as group 1 (Ctrl, raw key 224, + action 34); then Cruiser #2
# (initial 2) is selected, so it is the control object when the flagship is lost.
30 select-initial 1
33 keyevent-down 224
36 key 34
45 keyevent-up 224
60 select-initial 2
63 log-selection
120 log-flagship
# After tick 300: no escape pod; Cruiser #2 is now the flagship (so it leaves the selection).
480 log-flagship
483 log-selection
# Groups and orders still work: 1 recalls Cruiser #1, and a right-click moves it.
540 key 34
543 log-selection
600 rclick 200 420
603 log-selection
900 log-flagship
